{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207570","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207570","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1720757001:1":{"text":"Th-This is... the <style=\"highlight\">Feather of Truth</style>!","source_cn":"这、这是……<style=highlight>真理之羽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ABAF884EF35D8DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"Quill","source_cn":"羽毛笔","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E44F628920BAA68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720757002:1":{"text":"This quill looks just like any other... Are you sure it's a royal relic?","source_cn":"这看起来就是一支普通的羽毛笔……这真的是王室遗物之一吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F6292634C4B202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720757003:1":{"text":"Absolutely! My etiquette teacher told me it was crafted from a griffin feather that King Rolan himself plucked, which makes it extraordinarily valuable.","source_cn":"当然！我想起来了，礼仪课上老师特意讲过，传说这支笔的羽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDDF155C638B3BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720757004:1":{"text":"And King Rolan used it to sign the Lightbearer Code!","source_cn":"但它被作为王室遗物不是因为羽毛的珍贵，而是因为，这是罗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0